        <mxCell id="exp" value="&lt;h3&gt;URecoilComponent - Explanation&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;Role&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;: Kicks the camera when a weapon fires and recovers it smoothly.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;AddRecoil()&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;: Bound to &lt;code&gt;WeaponManager.OnShoot&lt;/code&gt;. The value comes from the weapon's data asset, so each gun feels different.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;TickComponent()&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;: The tick is enabled only while recovering and switched off afterwards.&lt;/p&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fillColor=#fffdf2;strokeColor=#d6b656;rounded=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
